      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just exhausting though. like, if the outcome is always going to be nothingness, why does it matter how much i struggle or how much i hurt along the way? every day feels like i'm just carrying this weight for no reason. if there's no objective meaning, then the suffering feels even more irrational, doesn't it?",
